  "2026-08-28T19:55:22.698Z",pi-agent,"PR review follow-up: fixed option values before runner words, evaluator recursion behind wrapper candidates, multiline substitution quote state, corepack forwarding, and unreadable executable-shaped paths. Added revert-sensitive tests. Restored seven history streams append-only and recorded explicit correction events; no prior event was rewritten."
  "2026-08-28T20:15:10.123Z",pi-agent,"Follow-up review: the release-note title now describes the refusal behavior rather than the historical defect; the negated-option, composite-action, and pipe-and-evaluator fixtures are being added in the same review cycle."
